sequenceDiagram
    participant View as SearchView
    participant Runtime as Search FeatureRuntime
    participant Reducer as GeneratedReducer
    participant RunnerA as EffectRunner 操作 A
    participant RunnerB as EffectRunner 操作 B
    participant Service as SearchService

    View->>Runtime: StartSearch(queryA)
    critical CommitGate
        Runtime->>Reducer: Reduce(snapshot, StartOperation A)
        Reducer-->>Runtime: Reduction(nextSnapshot gen 1, [EffectA], Accepted)
        Runtime->>Runtime: 原子接纳 generation 1 与统一 Snapshot
    end
    Runtime->>RunnerA: 执行 EffectA(generation 1, inputA)
    RunnerA->>Service: SearchAsync(queryA)

    View->>Runtime: StartSearch(queryB)
    critical CommitGate
        Runtime->>Reducer: Reduce(snapshot, StartOperation B)
        Reducer-->>Runtime: Reduction(nextSnapshot gen 2, [EffectB], Accepted)
        Runtime->>Runtime: 原子接纳 generation 2 与统一 Snapshot
    end
    Runtime-->>RunnerA: 请求取消 generation 1
    Runtime->>RunnerB: 执行 EffectB(generation 2, inputB)
    RunnerB->>Service: SearchAsync(queryB)
    Note over Runtime,Service: IO 不持 CommitGate；请求取消不保证外部任务立即结束

    Service-->>RunnerB: resultB
    RunnerB->>Runtime: UpdateAsync → 内部 Intent(generation 2, resultB)
    critical CommitGate
        Runtime->>Reducer: Reduce(currentSnapshot, resultIntent)
        Reducer->>Reducer: 核对 generation 2 仍有效
        Reducer-->>Runtime: Reduction(nextSnapshot, [], Accepted)
        Runtime->>Runtime: 原子提交结果 B 与 Version
    end
    Runtime-->>RunnerB: UpdateAsync 提交完成
    RunnerB->>Runtime: OperationCompleted Intent(generation 2)
    critical CommitGate
        Runtime->>Reducer: Reduce(currentSnapshot, completionIntent)
        Reducer-->>Runtime: Reduction(CompletedSnapshot, [], Accepted)
        Runtime->>Runtime: 原子提交 OperationStates 与 Version
    end
    Runtime-->>View: 直接调度最新结果 B 的展示投影

    Service-->>RunnerA: 迟到 resultA
    loop A 的结果、进度或完成反馈
        RunnerA->>Runtime: 内部 Intent(generation 1)
        critical CommitGate
            Runtime->>Reducer: Reduce(currentSnapshot, oldFeedback)
            Reducer->>Reducer: generation 1 已被 generation 2 取代
            Reducer-->>Runtime: Reduction(currentSnapshot, [], Superseded)
            Runtime->>Runtime: 拒绝提交；保留当前 State、OperationStates 与 Version
        end
        Runtime-->>RunnerA: Superseded
    end
    Note over Runtime,Reducer: 有效性在 Reduce 提交处判断；旧完成不能清除新操作状态
